sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Payer
  participant M as Merchant / POS
  participant G as Gateway / Processor
  participant A as Acquirer
  participant N as Simulated Network
  participant I as Issuer
  P->>M: AUTHORIZE (payment ID, operation ID, amount)
  M->>G: AUTHORIZE
  G->>A: AUTHORIZE
  A->>N: AUTHORIZE (Visa or Mastercard)
  N->>I: AUTHORIZE
  Note over I: Check token, active account, available funds\nIf approved, reserve hold; posted unchanged
  I-->>N: AUTH_RESULT (approved or declined, reason)
  N-->>A: AUTH_RESULT
  A-->>G: AUTH_RESULT
  G-->>M: AUTH_RESULT
  M-->>P: AUTH_RESULT / receipt
